#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: src/about/konq_aboutpage.cpp:140
#, kde-format
msgid "Konqueror makes working with and managing your files easy. You can browse both local and networked folders while enjoying advanced features such as the powerful sidebar and file previews."
msgstr "Konqueror wolóžuje dźěło z Wašimi datajemi. Móžeće lokalne a syćowe zapiski přehladować a při tym wudźěłane móžnosće wužiwać kaž mócny nabóčny pas a přehladki datajow."

#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: src/about/konq_aboutpage.cpp:144
#, kde-format
msgid "Konqueror is also a full featured and easy to use web browser which you can use to explore the Internet. Enter the address (e.g. <a href=\"http://www.kde.org\">http://www.kde.org</a>) of a web page you would like to visit in the location bar and press Enter, or choose an entry from the Bookmarks menu."
msgstr "Konqueror je tež połnohódna a přihódna čušlawa, kotruž móžeće za surfowanje w interneće wužiwać. Zapodajće adresu (na př. <a href=\"http://www.kde.org\">http://www.kde.org</a> web-strony, kotruž chceće wopytać, we pasu městnosće a stłóčće Enter, abo wubjerće něšto ze swojich zapołožkow."

#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: src/about/konq_aboutpage.cpp:149
#, kde-format
msgid "To return to the previous location, press the back button <img width='16' height='16' src=\"%1\"></img> in the toolbar. "
msgstr "Zo byšće so k prjedawšej městnosći wróćili, stłóčće knefl za \"wróćo\" <img width='16' height='16' src=\"%1\"></img> w nastrojowym pasu."

#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: src/about/konq_aboutpage.cpp:152
#, kde-format
msgid "To quickly go to your Home folder press the home button <img width='16' height='16' src=\"%1\"></img>."
msgstr "Zo byšće so spěšnje do swojeho domjaceho zapiska wróćili, stłóčće knefl \"Home\" <img width='16' height='16' src=\"%1\"></img>."

